{"id":"H8013","lemma":"שְׁלֹמוֹת","transliteration":"shelomot","sayIt":"she-lo-MOT","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Shelomoth","meaning":"A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.23.9;\nson of: Jehiel (H3171H);\nbrother of: Haziel (H2381) and Haran (H2039H)\nAlso named: she.lo.mit (שְׁלֹמִית \"Shelomoth\" H8019K)\n§ Shelomoth or Shelomith = \"peaceful\"\n1) a Gershonite Levite, son of Shimei in the time of David\n2) a Kohathite Levite of the sons of Izhar in the time of David\n3) a Gershonite Levite, son of Zichri in the time of David","glosses":["shelomoth","shelomith"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shelomoth","kjv":"Shelomoth"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shelomith","kjv":"Which Shelomith"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 24:22","note":"Of the Izharites, Shelomoth; of the sons of Shelomoth, Jahath.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H8019","lemma":"שְׁלֹמִית","transliteration":"shelomit","gloss":"Shelomith"},{"id":"H2147","lemma":"זִכְרִי","transliteration":"zikhri","gloss":"Zichri"},{"id":"H2039","lemma":"הָרָן","transliteration":"haran","gloss":"Haran"},{"id":"H2381","lemma":"חֲזִיאֵל","transliteration":"chaziel","gloss":"Haziel"},{"id":"H3171","lemma":"יְחִיאֵל","transliteration":"yechiel","gloss":"Jehiel"},{"id":"H3324","lemma":"יִצְהָר","transliteration":"yitshar","gloss":"Izhar"},{"id":"H7141","lemma":"קֹ֫רַח","transliteration":"qorach","gloss":"Korah"},{"id":"H5298","lemma":"נֶ֫פֶג","transliteration":"nepheg","gloss":"Nepheg"}],"senses":[{"id":"H8013H","gloss":"Shelomoth","relation":"H8013H ="},{"id":"H8013J","gloss":"Shelomoth","relation":"H8013J = a Name of"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}